1
00:00:00,562 --> 00:00:03,062
I'll take the heart-smart platter.

2
00:00:03,482 --> 00:00:05,312
All right, thank you. And Sheldon?

3
00:00:05,484 --> 00:00:07,734
(Sheldon:)We don't eat here.
I don't know what's good.

4
00:00:07,903 --> 00:00:10,443
- Well, it's all good.
- Statistically unlikely.

5
00:00:11,198 --> 00:00:13,328
(Leonard:)Just get a hamburger.
You like hamburgers.

6
00:00:13,492 --> 00:00:15,492
(Sheldon:)I like the hamburgers
where we usually eat.

7
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:18,700
(Sheldon:)You can't make the assumption
that I'll like the hamburgers here.

8
00:00:18,872 --> 00:00:21,502
(Leonard:)I'm sorry. Give him a hamburger.

9
00:00:21,666 --> 00:00:23,546
(Penny:)Which one,
the classic, the ranch house...

10
00:00:23,710 --> 00:00:25,920
...the barbeque burger
or the Kobe burger?

11
00:00:26,088 --> 00:00:28,008
(Sheldon:)Can't we just go to Big Boy?

12
00:00:28,173 --> 00:00:32,803
(Sheldon:)- They only have one burger, the Big Boy.
- The barbeque burger's like the Big Boy.

13
00:00:32,969 --> 00:00:35,349
(Sheldon:)In a world that already
includes a Big Boy...

14
00:00:35,514 --> 00:00:37,844
(Sheldon:)...why would I settle for something
like a Big Boy?

15
00:00:38,016 --> 00:00:40,146
(Penny:)Because you are not at Big Boy.

16
00:00:41,144 --> 00:00:43,854
- Fine. I'll have the barbeque burger.
- Make it two.

17
00:00:44,022 --> 00:00:46,312
(Sheldon:)Waitresses don't yell at you at Big Boy.

18
00:00:47,526 --> 00:00:48,906
(Lesley(entering):)Hey, Leonard. Hi, guys.

19
00:00:49,069 --> 00:00:50,239
(Penny:)- Hey.
- Hey, Leslie.

20
00:00:50,403 --> 00:00:54,113
- I didn't know you ate here.
- We don't. This is a disturbing aberration.

21
00:00:54,282 --> 00:00:57,492
Leslie, this is Penny, she lives across
the hall from Sheldon and me.

22
00:00:57,661 --> 00:01:01,021
(Howard:)And walks in quiet beauty
like the night.

